<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman starts Hertz coverage.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman starts Hertz coverage.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said it started coverage of Hertz as market outperform on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Shares slipped 1/8 to 27-1/2, a new low for the stock that went public at $24 a share on Friday but opened for trading on the New York Stock Exchange at $28.</p>
</text>
